5. Solution Overview
Replace all custom backend endpoints with a combination of Supabase client calls (for data and auth) and Next.js API routes / server actions (for sensitive operations like Razorpay payment verification). No Express/Fastify/NestJS server in production.
Architecture: Before vs After
Before (with backend)	After (backend-removal)
Browser → Backend API → Supabase	Browser → Supabase (direct) / Next.js Server Actions
2 deployments (frontend + backend server)	1 deployment (Vercel, Next.js only)
Custom auth middleware	Supabase RLS policies
Higher infra cost + ops overhead	Free/Pro tiers only, zero server maintenance

Key Flows
●	Product browsing: Supabase client directly queries products + categories tables
●	Authentication: @supabase/ssr handles session cookies in Next.js middleware
●	Cart: Zustand store (client state), persisted to Supabase on checkout
●	Checkout / Payment: Next.js server action calls Razorpay API, verifies signature server-side
●	Order confirmation: WhatsApp Business API sends confirmation message to customer
●	Admin panel: Supabase client + RLS restricts to admin role

